=⏳ Rate limit hit in {{ $('Prepare & Classify Error').first().json.workflow_name }}

Restarting via Execute Workflow after {{ $('Prepare & Classify Error').first().json.retry_after_seconds }}s delay...

Failed node: {{ $('Prepare & Classify Error').first().json.failed_node }}
rate_limit_wait_seconds={{ $('Prepare & Classify Error').first().json.retry_after_seconds }}

Resumability: Already-processed files will be skipped.

=🚨 n8n ALERT — infra / task-runner failure

A workflow failed with a Code-node / task-runner timeout, so the normal error pipeline (which starts with Code nodes) cannot run and would NOT alert you.

Workflow: {{ $json.workflow?.name || $json.workflow?.id }}
Failed node: {{ $json.execution?.error?.node?.name }}
Error: {{ $json.execution?.error?.message }}
Execution: {{ $json.execution?.id }}

Likely cause: external task runner is down or version-drifted vs primary.
Fix: Railway → redeploy n8n-runner + primary.

